Package: uk.lbsi.chargecap
Name: ChargeCap
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Stops charging at a percentage you choose.
 Holds the battery below full to slow its wear. Charging pauses at the
 limit (80% by default) and starts again once the battery falls to the
 resume level (75%). Set it in the ChargeCap app or with `chargecap`
 over SSH.
Maintainer: LBSiUK
Author: LBSiUK
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 9.0), uikittools
